{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mork Folio is a third party companion APP for the ENNIE Award winning Mork Bork RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Random indoor and\u00a0 outdoor encounter generators provides dozens of encounters for use with your OSR adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Adds dozens of new and original creatures to your Mork Borg adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Browse through Mork Folio to help you plan your next Mork Borg adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Random monster generator allows for fast and exciting content to be generated on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Monsters contain detailed descriptions, stat boxes and pictures to bring your adventure to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* New Oracle system helps solo players craft better adventures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Want some custom atmospheric audio to go with your Mork Borg adventure? Ya thats in Mork Folio too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more wasting time fumbling for random tables or creature sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mork Folio was designed, built and published by experienced Mork Borg players who know what you need to run a successful adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3908780?t=1766681591","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908780/3b99dec2b3c7969315cd90fed3abccda6d8501ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766681591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908780/95b34299c27a10d875cea5d29992d9c278cc78c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766681591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908780/95b34299c27a10d875cea5d29992d9c278cc78c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766681591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages: Some Violence or Gore, General Mature Content.\r\n\r\n "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mork Folio is a third party companion APP for the ENNIE Award winning Mork Bork RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Random indoor and\u00a0 outdoor encounter generators provides dozens of encounters for use with your OSR adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Adds dozens of new and original creatures to your Mork Borg adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Browse through Mork Folio to help you plan your next Mork Borg adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Random monster generator allows for fast and exciting content to be generated on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Monsters contain detailed descriptions, stat boxes and pictures to bring your adventure to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* New Oracle system helps solo players craft better adventures.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Want some custom atmospheric audio to go with your Mork Borg adventure? Ya thats in Mork Folio too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more wasting time fumbling for random tables or creature sheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mork Folio was designed, built and published by experienced Mork Borg players who know what you need to run a successful adventure.</p>","developers":["Zany Gadgets Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908780/ef380d9b7ddcf1973934a577c9e4bf551c820ee6/header.jpg?t=1766681591","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 11.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel N4100 (or similar) or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:<